description:
Origin: onobumba/oomakhi, oomakhi-q9f.10. Related FreeCAD-qv9 covers GUI repaint overhead; this narrower enhancement concerns progress/cancellation propagation inside native compound cut recursion. Source implementation belongs to a separate session; no FreeCAD source changed here.

Tested runtime: /Applications/FreeCAD-27.1.0.app, 27.1.0 dev49114+121, commit93340a47b4c1f79b2ac32b704e45e5a21706b72c; sampled Qt6.11.2/OCC8.0.1, macOS27.0.1. Source inspection checkout bd674b64500e870d6aaba06bf8c46db00558a44e is identified separately; retained evidence says whether each inspected file matches the runtime commit.

Expected: long stock Part.Shape.cut operations involving nested compounds should forward usable progress and cancellation into nested kernel work. Observed: a retained whole-compound symmetric comparison remained active >5min with about287%CPU (parent observation); desktop observation timed out. The process sample captured nested FCBRepAlgoAPI_BooleanOperation::RecursiveCutCompound -> Build() -> Build(progressRange) -> OCC PaveFiller. One ordinary Escape attempt timed out; cancellation was not demonstrated, and input delivery is unverified. No crash/deadlock/geometry correctness regression is established.

Source candidate: src/Mod/Part/App/FCBRepAlgoAPI_BooleanOperation.cpp lines180..203 and283..308: Build() constructs a default Message_ProgressRange; RecursiveCutCompound invokes nested Build() instead of forwarding a parent progress subrange. Direct Build(progressRange) checks UserBreak and forwards the range to OCC. src/Gui/ProgressBar.cpp Escape event filter calls Sequencer.tryToCancel. This motivates inspection/testing, not a proven full causal diagnosis.

Reproduction available: Oomakhi artifacts/Structural-Integration/r02/compare_saved_native_geometry.py calls detached stored.cut(current) and current.cut(stored) on protected saved compound owners during the fixed FoundationBottom -1000 -> -1200 test. Exact saved baseline/changed models remain in native/ground-proof/; source report pins comparator/sample/runtime evidence. A minimal stock compound reproducer and controlled visible Escape/cancellation timing remain outstanding; no extra investigation was started just to file this report.

No verified stock cancellation workaround. The building-project comparison successor now compares bounded mismatched individual solids instead of whole compounds; that is not a native source fix, nor evidence that the current building proof is complete.

