Acceptance for the separate source session: create a minimal stock nested-compound cut case; measure progress/cancellation and native geometry equivalence; establish whether parent progress/cancellation ranges are dropped; if supported, propagate subranges/abort checks through both recursive compound/tool paths without changing Boolean geometry or exception semantics. Demonstrate a delivered ordinary GUI Escape can cancel within a stated bounded interval and leave the document intact, while a completed noncancelled run yields the same geometry. Preserve timing/evidence and distinguish active kernel work from deadlock.
